#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "An introduction to the basics of quantum computing, designed to get you started as quickly as possible."
msgstr "Pengantar dasar-dasar komputasi kuantum, dirancang agar kamu bisa memulai secepat mungkin."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr "![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/use-a-qc-today/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome to *Use a quantum computer today*! In the course, you'll start using a quantum computer immediately, and learn the basic principles of quantum computing along the way.\n"
msgstr "Selamat datang di *Gunakan komputer kuantum hari ini*! Di kursus ini, kamu langsung mulai menggunakan komputer kuantum dan mempelajari prinsip-prinsip dasar komputasi kuantum sepanjang perjalanan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This course is designed for the curious and the busy. You don't need a physics degree or years of programming experience. If you can follow along with a notebook and click \"Run,\" you're ready.\n"
msgstr "Kursus ini dirancang untuk orang yang penasaran dan yang sibuk. Kamu tidak perlu gelar fisika atau pengalaman pemrograman bertahun-tahun. Kalau kamu bisa mengikuti notebook dan klik \"Run,\" kamu sudah siap.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam {#exam}"
msgstr "Ujian {#exam}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To earn your badge for the \"Using a quantum computer\" course, take the exam at IBM&reg; Training. This exam is intended to be taken after reading the lessons in this course. After you pass the exam, you will be notified by Credly that you have earned a badge.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan lencanamu untuk kursus \"Using a quantum computer\", ikuti ujian di IBM&reg; Training. Ujian ini dimaksudkan untuk diambil setelah membaca pelajaran dalam kursus ini. Setelah kamu lulus ujian, kamu akan diberi tahu oleh Credly bahwa kamu telah mendapatkan lencana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Exam](/learning/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam)\n"
msgstr "[Ujian](/learning/courses/use-a-qc-today/exam)\n"

